      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eighteen. Tells Seri about her own gap for the first time: \"It was mine. One more person just got to know it.\" Finishes, after fourteen years, the sentence she couldn't finish at five: \"A song comes from the old Seri in the warehouse.\""
